sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Auth as ASGI AuthMiddleware<br/>Bearer Token Check
    participant OpenAI as OpenAI Router<br/>/v1/chat/completions
    participant Anthropic as Anthropic Router<br/>/v1/messages
    participant Native as Native vLLM Router<br/>/generate
    participant Engine as AsyncLLMEngine<br/>CPU Backend
    participant S3 as S3 / ModelScope<br/>Model Storage
    participant Exa as Exa Search API<br/>(MCP Tool)
    participant Docker as Docker Daemon<br/>(MCP Sandbox)

    Note over Client,Engine: Inference Request Flow (OpenAI-Compatible)

    Client->>Auth: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer {VLLM_API_KEY}<br/>Port 8000
    Auth->>Auth: Validate bearer token<br/>against VLLM_API_KEY
    alt Token Invalid
        Auth-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
    end
    Auth->>OpenAI: Forward authenticated request
    OpenAI->>Engine: Submit inference request
    Engine->>Engine: CPU model execution<br/>(AsyncLLMEngine)
    Engine-->>OpenAI: Inference result
    OpenAI-->>Client: JSON response<br/>(streaming or non-streaming)

    Note over Client,Engine: Inference Request Flow (Anthropic-Compatible)

    Client->>Auth: POST /v1/messages<br/>Authorization: Bearer {VLLM_API_KEY}
    Auth->>Anthropic: Forward authenticated request
    Anthropic->>Engine: Submit inference request
    Engine-->>Anthropic: Inference result
    Anthropic-->>Client: JSON response

    Note over Client,Engine: Inference Request Flow (Native vLLM)

    Client->>Auth: POST /generate<br/>Authorization: Bearer {VLLM_API_KEY}
    Auth->>Native: Forward authenticated request
    Native->>Engine: Submit inference request
    Engine-->>Native: Inference result
    Native-->>Client: JSON response

    Note over Engine,S3: Model Loading (Startup)

    Engine->>S3: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443<br/>Auth: S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY or<br/>MODELSCOPE_API_TOKEN
    S3-->>Engine: Model weights & config

    Note over Engine,Docker: Optional MCP Tool Calls

    Engine->>Exa: Web search request<br/>HTTPS<br/>Auth: EXA_API_KEY
    Exa-->>Engine: Search results
    Engine->>Docker: Code execution request<br/>Docker socket
    Docker-->>Engine: Execution output

    Note over Client,Engine: LoRA Adapter Management

    Client->>Auth: POST /v1/load_lora_adapter<br/>Authorization: Bearer {VLLM_API_KEY}
    Auth->>Engine: Load LoRA adapter
    Engine->>Engine: Merge adapter weights
    Engine-->>Client: 200 OK

    Note over Client,Engine: Health / Operational

    Client->>Auth: GET /health
    Auth-->>Client: 200 OK (healthy)
    Client->>Auth: GET /ready
    Auth-->>Client: 200 OK (model loaded)
